# raspberrypi.sources — SCOPED apt source for the Raspberry Pi downstream kernel (ADR 0029 D3).
#
# Consumed ONLY by builder/mkosi-arm64/make-pi-image.sh's cached, non-privileged
# `podman ... apt-get download` staging step — NEVER added to mkosi.conf, so the arm64-UEFI/
# virt rootfs (and every other platform) stays 100% Debian-canon (ADR 0029 D2). This file is
# copied into a throwaway podman container for the fetch only; it is never installed on a
# shipped device.
#
# Signed-By is pinned to rpi-keyring/raspberrypi-archive-keyring.gpg (vendored in this repo,
# pinned + SHA-256'd in base/drivers/SOURCES.md — fingerprint
# CF8A 1AF5 02A2 AA2D 763B AE7E 82B1 2992 7FA3 303E, "Raspberry Pi Archive Signing Key",
# confirmed 2026-07-08 by direct extraction from raspberrypi-archive-keyring_2021.1.1+rpt1_all.deb).
# Scoping the key to THIS file only means it can verify RPi-repo packages and nothing else —
# it never becomes a system-wide trust anchor (ADR 0029 D3.2).
Types: deb
URIs: https://archive.raspberrypi.com/debian
Suites: bookworm
Components: main
Architectures: arm64
Signed-By: /rpi-keyring/raspberrypi-archive-keyring.gpg
